okbook:Pound|pound]] [[Cookbook:Ground Beef|ground beef]]\n* ½ pound bulk [[Cookbook:Sausage|sausage]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]], [[cookbook:Beat|beat]]en\n* 6 soda crackers, [[cookbook:Crumble|crumble]]d\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Chili Powder|chili powder]]\n* ½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* ¼ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n* ~1 can [[cookbook:Cheddar Cheese|cheddar cheese]] [[cookbook:Soup|soup]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to [[Cookbook:Oven_temperatures|350°F]].\n# Place sliced potatoes in [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|baking dish]].\n# Place sliced onion over potatoes in baking dish.\n# Combine all ingredients except cheddar cheese soup, and mix well.\n# Press into baking dish, forming an indentation in the middle.\n# Pour cheddar cheese soup in indentation.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] 1 hour at [[Cookbook:Oven_temperatures|350°F]].\n# Stand 5 minutes before serving.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n* Serving suggestion: Cut vertically with metal spatula, which will yield potato, onion, meat, and cheese in every serving.\n* If it is not possible to buy pre-seasoned bulk pork sausage where you live, see the recipe for [[Cookbook:bulk sausage|bulk sausage]].\n\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes for casserole]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Midwestern U.S. recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheddar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chili powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Potato Meat Loaf","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"4","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"4 medium potatoes, sliced","sourceText":"4 medium potatoes, sliced","amountText":"4 medium potatoes, sliced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 onion, sliced","sourceText":"1 onion, sliced","amountText":"1 onion, sliced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foo